---

<SiteLayout
  title="FDE FAN | 企业 AI 落地服务商 · 智能体共建 · 人才培养 · AI 诊断"
  description="让 AI 真正落地企业，不止于认知，而是业务闭环。以 FDE 工程师培养为人才底座，以智能体共建为业务引擎，以企业诊断为精准入口 —— 帮企业从「不懂 AI」走到「AI 跑通一个业务场景」。"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative isolate bg-[#05070d] overflow-hidden pt-20 pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <img src="/assets/hero2.png" alt="FDE FAN Hero Background" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-70 z-[-2] pointer-events-none" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#05070d]/50 via-[#05070d]/30 to-[#05070d] z-[-1] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-7xl h-96 bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-500/15 via-blue-500/5 to-transparent blur-3xl z-[-1] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
      <!-- Tag Pill Badge -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-400/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium tracking-wide mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>FDE · Forward Deployed Engineer · 企业 AI 落地服务商</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight tracking-tight mb-4">
        让 AI <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-sky-300 to-indigo-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">真正落地企业</span><br />
        不止于认知，而是业务闭环
      </h1>

      <!-- Subheadline -->
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">
        以 FDE 工程师培养为人才底座，以智能体共建为业务引擎，以企业诊断为精准入口
        <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        —— 帮企业从「不懂 AI」走到「AI 跑通一个业务场景」。
      </p>

      <!-- Action Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-16">
        <a
          href="/survey/818"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-sm sm:text-base hover:bg-cyan-300 shadow-xl shadow-cyan-400/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5"
        >
          <span>开始企业 AI 诊断</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="#services"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700/80 text-slate-200 font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition-all flex items-center justify-center"
        >
          <span>了解服务体系</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 Key Highlights Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 pt-10 border-t border-slate-800/80 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-cyan-400 font-mono">3</div>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium mt-1">核心服务板块</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-cyan-400 font-mono">4-5天</div>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium mt-1">FDE 深度交付周期</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-cyan-400 font-mono">6周</div>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium mt-1">工程师实战培养</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-cyan-400 font-mono">10人</div>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium mt-1">精品小班制</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Three Core Services Section ("三大服务板块") -->
  <section id="services" class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">三大服务板块</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
        以 FDE 为核心入口，打通「人才 → 落地 → 诊断」的企业 AI 全链路服务闭环。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Card 1: FDE 企业落地工程师实战培养 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 border-t-2 border-t-cyan-400 p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-2xl hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-all group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-400/30 text-cyan-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6">
            🎓
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
            FDE 企业落地工程师实战培养
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 mb-4">
            FDE Enterprise Implementation Engineer Bootcamp
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            把 FDE 的真实交付方法改造排练成可落地的训练体系：先定义问题，再调用 AI 工具，最后用作品和交付证明能力。
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-6 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>6 周实战 · 真实项目驱动</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>意图澄清 → 上下文工程 → 工具调用 → 分支交付 → 评估审计</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>10 人精品小班 · 能力评审 · 就业保障</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>面向企业员工、技术人员、高校学生</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a href="/future-camp" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-colors">
            <span>查看培养路径</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: 企业智能体共建 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 border-t-2 border-t-emerald-400 p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-2xl hover:border-emerald-400/50 transition-all group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-400/30 text-emerald-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6">
            ⚙️
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">
            企业智能体共建
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 mb-4">
            Enterprise AI Agent Co-Building
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            企业提供真实业务场景，我们提供 AI 能力与工程实现，共同跑通一个可交付的业务闭环 —— 不是 PPT，是上线。
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-6 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>企业出场景 + 我们出 AI 能力 = 共建闭环</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>从需求拆解到 Agent 设计、开发、部署上线</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>覆盖跨境商贸、文旅、教务、后勤等真实场景</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>交付物：可运行 Agent + 文档 + 验收报告</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a href="/diagnosis" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-colors">
            <span>提交业务场景</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: 企业 AI 诊断 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 border-t-2 border-t-amber-500 p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-2xl hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-all group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-400/30 text-amber-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6">
            🔍
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">
            企业 AI 诊断
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 mb-4">
            Enterprise AI Readiness Diagnosis
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            免费 AI 就绪度诊断，帮企业看清：当前 AI 应用水平、效率瓶颈在哪、哪些场景最值得优先用 AI 改造。
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-6 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>填写诊断问卷 → AI 生成定制化诊断报告</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>综合评分 + 雷达图 + 痛点分析 + 落地建议</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>A/B/C 级线索分层 · 高意向企业 24h 跟进</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">•</span>
              <span>报告含可执行的行动建议清单</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a href="/survey/818" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-colors">
            <span>立即参与诊断</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Market Demand & Salary Analysis Section (放在服务板块下方) -->
  <section class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-8 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-400/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-semibold mb-2">
        <span>MARKET DEMAND & SALARY</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        巨大的 FDE 人才缺口与薪资红利
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2">
        全球市场需求旺盛，具备“业务理解 + AI应用开发/工程实现 + 交付落地”能力的复合型人才最受欢迎。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 shadow-2xl p-2 sm:p-4">
      <img
        src="/assets/fde-salary-analysis.png"
        alt="FDE 招聘需求与薪资分析"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-cover"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Camp Apply Section -->
  <section class="section-wrap band" id="camp-apply">
    <div class="camp-apply-grid">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">APPLY</p>
        <h2><span class="zh">提交 FDE 实战营首期样板班申请</span><span class="en">Apply for FDE Enterprise Bootcamp</span></h2>
        <p><span class="zh">第一期是样板工程，我们只招 10 名愿意完成真实项目的学员。提交后，我们会安排面谈评估。</span><span class="en">The prototype cohort is limited to 10 dedicated candidates. We will schedule an interview after submission.</span></p>
        <a class="cta-secondary" href="/future-camp"><span class="zh">查看实战营详细介绍</span><span class="en">View Camp Details</span></a>
      </div>
      <form class="camp-apply-form" data-camp-form>
        <label>
          <span class="zh">姓名</span><span class="en">Name</span>
          <input name="studentName" required autocomplete="name" />
        </label>
        <label>
          <span class="zh">专业学历 / 过往经历</span><span class="en">Background / Experience</span>
          <input name="ageGrade" placeholder="例如：计算机本科/3年运营经验" required />
        </label>
        <label>
          <span class="zh">联系邮箱</span><span class="en">Email</span>
          <input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
        </label>
        <label>
          <span class="zh">微信 / 电话</span><span class="en">WeChat / Phone</span>
          <input name="contact" required />
        </label>
        <label>
          <span class="zh">期望岗位方向</span><span class="en">Expected Role</span>
          <select name="track">
            <option value="企业AI应用工程师">企业AI应用工程师 / Enterprise AI Engineer</option>
            <option value="AI产品助理/顾问">AI产品助理/顾问 / AI Product Assistant</option>
            <option value="跨境电商AI运营">跨境电商AI运营 / Cross-border AI Ops</option>
            <option value="知识库/工作流工程师">知识库/工作流工程师 / Knowledge Base Engineer</option>
            <option value="其他">其他 / Other</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="full">
          <span class="zh">每周可投入时间及AI使用经验</span><span class="en">Time Availability & AI Experience</span>
          <textarea name="notes" rows="4" placeholder="请简述你每周可用于项目实战的时间，以及过去使用过哪些大模型或工具（如 Dify, Coze 等）。" required></textarea>
        </label>
        <button class="cta-primary" type="submit"><span class="zh">提交申请资料</span><span class="en">Submit Application</span></button>
        <p class="camp-form-note" data-camp-form-note>
          <span class="zh">提交后会保存到 FDE 报名数据库，我们将会尽快与你联系面谈。</span>
          <span class="en">Submission will be saved. We will contact you shortly for an interview.</span>
        </p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Alliance Members Marquee Section -->
  <section class="alliance-section" aria-label="FDE alliance members">
    <div class="alliance-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">FDE ALLIANCE</p>
      <h2><span class="zh">FDE 联盟成员</span><span class="en">FDE Alliance Members</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="alliance-marquee">
      <div class="alliance-track" data-alliance-track data-member-count={allianceMemberCount}>
        {allianceMarquee.map((member) => (
          <div class="alliance-item">
            <span class={`alliance-logo ${member.type}`}>
              <img src={member.image} alt={`${member.name} logo`} loading="lazy" />
            </span>
            <span class="alliance-copy">
              <strong>{member.name}</strong>
              {member.org && <small>{member.org}</small>}
            </span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const track = document.querySelector("[data-alliance-track]");
    if (track instanceof HTMLElement) {
      const count = Number(track.dataset.memberCount || 0);
      const sourceItems = Array.from(track.children).slice(0, count);
      for (let index = sourceItems.length - 1; index > 0; index -= 1) {
        const swapIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * (index + 1));
        [sourceItems[index], sourceItems[swapIndex]] = [sourceItems[swapIndex], sourceItems[index]];
      }
      const firstLoop = sourceItems.map((item) => item.cloneNode(true));
      const secondLoop = sourceItems.map((item) => item.cloneNode(true));
      track.replaceChildren(...firstLoop, ...secondLoop);
    }

    const campForm = document.querySelector("[data-camp-form]");
    const campFormNote = document.querySelector("[data-camp-form-note]");
    campForm?.addEventListener("submit", async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (!(campForm instanceof HTMLFormElement)) return;

      const formData = new FormData(campForm);
      const payload = Object.fromEntries(formData.entries());
      const submitButton = campForm.querySelector("button[type='submit']");

      if (submitButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {
        submitButton.disabled = true;
      }

      try {
        const response = await fetch("/api/future-camp/apply", {
          method: "POST",
          headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });
        const result = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (!response.ok || result?.ok !== true) {
          throw new Error(result?.message || "提交失败，请稍后重试。");
        }
        campForm.reset();
        if (campFormNote instanceof HTMLElement) {
          campFormNote.textContent = "报名信息已保存，我们会尽快联系你。";
          campFormNote.classList.add("active");
        }
      } catch (error) {
        if (campFormNote instanceof HTMLElement) {
          campFormNote.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "提交失败，请稍后重试。";
          campFormNote.classList.remove("active");
        }
      } finally {
        if (submitButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {
          submitButton.disabled = false;
        }
      }
    });
  </script>
</SiteLayout>
